            "review_text": "phan p\nHanoi, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nVietnamese food is especially delicious\nApr 2024 • Friends\nI've had so many delicious dishes in Vietnam and every dish has been exciting, with a variety of natural spices and the food balances the taste buds. You can feel it when you eat the bread here, this is a great bakery in a city famous for its bread. The restaurant serves 4 main sandwiches: roast pork sandwich, fish cake sandwich, vegetarian sandwich and chicken sandwich. Really diverse, something for everyone.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten April 4, 2024",
